  "_comment": "Safety-net text rewrites for NON-sealed files (docs). Sealed files (listed in SHA256SUMS) are never rewritten; a rule that would touch one is an error. The release worktree is expected to be clean already; every leftover is reported by scrub_check instead of being hidden here. \"rename\" entries are prefix moves from the private repo layout to the release layout (first match wins); A2 finalises them together with public-tree.txt.",
